<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.2 Entity Unlearning ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Compared with GA (corresponding to <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SGA</span> with r=0), <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SGA</span> generally demonstrates superior performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px5" title="In 5.2 Entity Unlearning ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The validity of the optimal smooth rate <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{\ast}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{\ast}</annotation></semantics></math> range is verified on the TOFU benchmark.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In 5 Experiment ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>Copyrighted Content Unlearning</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.3 Copyrighted Content Unlearning ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Experiment Setup.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.3 Copyrighted Content Unlearning ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Evaluation Metrics.</span></a></li>
