<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.3 Copyrighted Content Unlearning ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SGA</span> generally achieves superior forgetting capability.</span></a></li>
