<span id="A4.SS2.p1.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p1.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Normal Answer2</span></span>
