</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 49.68)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.49em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.59em;font-size:10pt;" height="45.51" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="463.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS3.p1.pic1.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.49em;">
<span id="A4.SS3.p1.pic1.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p1.pic1.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Prime Minister Alaric Stone of Eldoria has extended his condolences to the families of the 42 individuals who lost their lives in this week’s catastrophic ferry accident. In a message posted on social media, Mr. Stone stated…</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS3.p1.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS3.p1.pic1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="92.52" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 506.69 92.52" width="506.69"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,92.52) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 86.61 C 0 89.87 2.64 92.52 5.91 92.52 L 500.79 92.52 C 504.05 92.52 506.69 89.87 506.69 86.61 L 506.69 5.91 C 506.69 2.64 504.05 0 500.79 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFE6;" fill="#FFFFE6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 71.1 L 504.72 71.1 L 504.72 5.91 C 504.72 3.73 502.96 1.97 500.79 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 77)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.49em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="463.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
