<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this paper, we employ large language models (LLMs) to assist us in grammar checking and polishing the manuscript. Additionally, we leverage GPT-4o-mini to generate the normal data required for our experiments, as detailed in Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Prompt for Generating Normal Data ‣ Label Smoothing Improves Gradient Ascent in LLM Unlearning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</article>
